{"id":"00351","root":"uni00351_1","name":{"ja":"水城　不知火","en":"Mizuki Shiranui"},"title":{"ja":"【ビーチな人妻】","en":"【Beach Housewife】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ビーチな人妻】 水城　不知火","en":"【Beach Housewife】 Mizuki Shiranui"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-06-30","limited":true,"characterId":5,"profile":{"ja":"ゆきかぜの母親。対魔忍不知火として勇名をはせていたが、５年前にある任務中に行方不明に。夫は彼女が行方不明になってから４年後に任務中に死亡している。対魔忍の隊長を務めるアサギの良きサポート役として戦闘能力だけでなく知略に長けたゆきかぜにとって憧れの母親であった。","en":"She is Mizuki Yukikaze's mother. Once renowned as the Taimanin \"Shiranui,\" she vanished during a mission five years ago. Her husband died on a mission four years after her disappearance. As a trusted support to the Taimanin captain Asagi, she was not only a formidable combatant but also a strategic mind, making her the admired mother figure that Mizuki Yukikaze looks up to."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"ももぞの薫","forms":[{"id":"uni00351_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1218,2436],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[187,374],"def":[124,248],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","660004"]},{"id":"uni00351_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1836,3672],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[299,598],"def":[173,346],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","660004","660005"]},{"id":"uni00351_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2454,4941],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[411,820],"def":[222,442],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","660004","660005","660006"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"}]},"660004":{"slot":"skill1","id":660004,